@mkhona-nvidia Thanks, I will follow that sequence: #6326 lands first, and #8004 depends on it.

I am updating this PR to build on #6326 and reuse its QKV/MLA layout and TP/GTP handling. The remaining changes will cover semantic optimizer routing for output/control gates, GDN1/2, dense SwiGLU, and MLA down projections, with their regression tests. I will preserve the base PR's default behavior and document the opt-in extensions.

I will record the dependency revision and rerun validation after integration. The existing GPU results apply to the previous head, not the upcoming revision. This dependent PR must be retargeted to `main` before #6326 is merged or its bot mirror is deleted; #8004 must be merged only after #6326 has landed.

